# Spec for tools/riscpkg.py: the text recognition plugin, from FolioOCR-<ver>.zip.
Package: FolioOCR
Section: Document
Priority: Optional
Licence: Free
Maintainer: Andrew Youll <adyoull@users.noreply.github.com>
Standards-Version: 0.4.0
Environment: any
Depends: Folio
Homepage: https://github.com/adyoull/riscos-folio
Description: Text recognition (OCR) for Folio, English
 Lets Folio recognise the text on scanned pages, so they can be
 searched, selected, copied and read aloud. Tesseract's English data
 in two modes, Accurate and Fast. It goes into Folio's Plugins
 directory; Folio finds it the next time it starts.
Build-Map: !Folio/Plugins/OCR -> Apps/Document/!Folio/Plugins/OCR
Build-Notice: The text recognition plugin for Folio, packaged for PackMan
 from the release zip on https://github.com/adyoull/riscos-folio/releases
 .
 The data is Tesseract's English traineddata (tessdata and tessdata_fast,
 with the legacy engine's parts taken out), under the Apache License 2.0,
 which follows.
Build-Copyright: !Folio/Plugins/OCR/DataLicence
